Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.20,0:04:18.57,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.1\blur8\3c&HFFFFFF&}何度でも　何度でも叫ぶ
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.57,0:04:19.82,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}何度でも　何度でも叫ぶ
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.82,0:04:21.20,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.1\blur8\3c&HFFFFFF&}何度でも　何度でも叫ぶ
